  "prefLabel": "Cub 301.23 Value-added agricultural products",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cub 301.23 “Value-added agricultural products” means products or materials grown on farm land and processed beyond their natural state as harvested, for market or sale.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Cub 300) #12857-B, eff 8-23-19",
